# Read the room
@scenario office_lesson_03
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk point]
pip: I just heard a knock behind the glass. Watch my face before I tell you what it means.
[show pip desk surprised]
pip: Did you hear that?
[show pip desk curious]
pip: Swap surprised for curious in the second show command. Compare the meaning of the same line.
@label check
pip: How do you change my reaction in place?
> Show pip in the same slot with another expression. -> correct
> Declare a new background named curious. -> retry
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: The slot stays occupied while its expression changes. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: The slot stays occupied while its expression changes.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_03]
[flag tutorial_done_03]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_1]
